        "routeSummary": "Free Neil Island Visit",
        "overviewText": "The **Andaman Highlights – 5 Days 4 Nights** tour is designed to feel **unhurried, smooth, and deeply refreshing**, even though it’s a short-duration [Andaman trip](https://indiatour.live/andaman).\n\nFrom the moment you arrive in **[Port Blair](https://indiatour.live/attractions/port-blair)**, the experience is all about **ease and flow**. Transfers are organised, stays are well-located, and travel between islands is thoughtfully planned so that you spend **more time enjoying Andaman and less time worrying about logistics**.\n\nThis tour doesn’t try to cram too much into five days. Instead, it focuses on what Andaman does best—slow island life, scenic beaches, and meaningful time at each destination.\n\nOne of the biggest advantages of this **5 days Andaman tour package** is its pacing.\n\nInstead of packing too many places into limited days, the tour focuses on:\n\n- Experiencing Andaman’s **most popular islands**\n- Allowing enough leisure time at beaches\n- Avoiding unnecessary travel fatigue\n\nTravellers get to enjoy the charm of **Port Blair**, the iconic beaches of **[Havelock Island](https://indiatour.live/attractions/havelock-island)**, and the peaceful vibe of **Neil Island**—all within a comfortable 5-day timeframe.\n\nThis balance is what makes the package suitable for **families, couples, and senior travellers**.\n\n\n### Places Covered in the Andaman Highlights Tour\n### \nWhat makes this **[Andaman holiday package](https://indiatour.live/tours/amazing-andaman)** stand out is that each destination offers a distinct experience:\n\n- **Port Blair: [Corbyn's Cove](https://indiatour.live/attractions/corbyns-cove-beach), Jail Museum, Cellular Jail Light & Sound Show, [Sagarika Emporium Shopping Complex](https://indiatour.live/attractions/sagarika-government-emporium-andaman)**\n- **Havelock Island** (via private ferry ride): White Sand Radhanagar Beach - 7th Most Beautiful Beach in the world\n- **Neil Island** (via Ferry Ride): Bharatpur beach, Laxmanpur Beach, [Natural Coral Bridge](https://indiatour.live/attractions/natural-bridge-neil-island)\n\nTogether, they create a **well-rounded Andaman tourism experience**, even within a short trip duration.\n\n### Experiences & Activities You Can Enjoy on This Tour\n### \nThis Andaman tour package allows you to enjoy a mix of **relaxation, sightseeing, and optional adventure**, depending on your travel style.\n\n- Relax on pristine beaches and enjoy slow island mornings\n- Experience scenic ferry rides between islands with ocean views\n- Explore coral-rich waters through optional **snorkelling or scuba diving**\n- Enjoy peaceful sunsets and photography on less-crowded beaches\n- Attend the iconic **[Cellular Jail](https://indiatour.live/attractions/cellular-jail) Light & Sound Show** for a cultural experience\n- Shop for local souvenirs and handicrafts in Port Blair\n\nThe flexibility to choose your pace—whether relaxed or activity-focused—is what makes this tour appealing to a wide range of Indian travellers.\n\nDiscover the [Best of Andaman with India Tour Experiences](https://indiatour.live/tours/andaman-tour-package).",
