      "overviewText": "The **Amazing Andaman – 6 Days 5 Nights** tour is designed for travellers who want a **complete Andaman island experience** with the right balance of **exploration, beach time, and relaxation**.\n\nThis tour gives you **one extra day compared to shorter packages**, which makes a noticeable difference. The pace feels calmer, the travel feels lighter, and the experience feels more immersive—without stretching the trip too long.\n\nFrom the moment you arrive in **[Port Blair](https://indiatour.live/attractions/port-blair)**, the journey flows smoothly. Island transfers are thoughtfully planned, stays are well-positioned, and the overall structure allows you to **enjoy Andaman without constantly watching the clock**.\n\n\n### A Perfectly Balanced 6 Days Andaman Tour Package\n### \nOne of the biggest strengths of this **6 days Andaman tour package** is how evenly the journey is spread across islands.\n\nInstead of rushing through locations, this tour focuses on:\n\n- Spending quality time on **Andaman’s most popular islands**\n- Allowing enough beach leisure and downtime\n- Including activities without exhausting the traveller\n- Maintaining a relaxed, holiday-like pace\n\nTravellers get to experience the charm of **Port Blair**, the scenic beauty of **[Havelock Island](https://indiatour.live/attractions/havelock-island)**, and the peaceful surroundings of **Neil Island**—comfortably across six days.\n\nThis makes the package ideal for **families, couples, honeymooners, and first-time [Andaman travellers](https://indiatour.live/andaman)**.\n\n### Places Covered in the Amazing Andaman Tour\n### \nWhat makes this **[Andaman holiday package](https://indiatour.live/andaman)** especially rewarding is the variety it offers across destinations.\n\n- **Port Blair** – Corbyn's Cove, Jail Museum, [Cellular Jail](https://indiatour.live/attractions/cellular-jail), Light & Sound Show, [Sagarika Emporium Shopping Complex](https://indiatour.live/attractions/sagarika-government-emporium-andaman)\n- **Havelock Island** – White Sand [Radhanagar Beach](https://indiatour.live/attractions/radhanagar-beach) - 7th Most Beautiful Beach in the World, Elephant Beach\n- **[Neil Island](https://indiatour.live/attractions/neil-island)** – Bharatpur Beach, Bharatpur Beach, Natural Coral Bridge\n\nTogether, these places create a **well-rounded [Andaman tourism](https://indiatour.live/andaman) experience**, where no two days feel the same.\n\n\n### Experiences & Activities Included in the Amazing Andaman Tour\n### \nThis package is ideal for travellers who want to **experience Andaman beyond just sightseeing**.\n\n#### Beach & Island Experiences\n#### \n- Relax on pristine beaches with unhurried mornings\n- Enjoy scenic ferry rides with panoramic ocean views\n- Experience the calm, slow pace that Andaman is known for\n\n#### Water & Adventure Experiences\n#### \n- **Free snorkelling at [Elephant Beach](https://indiatour.live/attractions/elephant-beach)**, one of Andaman’s most popular coral spots\n- Optional **scuba diving and sea walking** for adventure lovers\n- Safe, beginner-friendly water activities guided by professionals\n\n#### Cultural & Local Experiences\n#### \n- Attend the iconic **Cellular Jail Light & Sound Show**\n- Explore local markets and shop for souvenirs in Port Blair\n\nThe mix of **free included experiences and optional adventures** makes this package appealing to a wide range of travellers.\n\n### Why This Amazing Andaman Package Is Great Value\n### \n- **Starts at ₹26,500 per person** (Save ₹3,000)\n- Includes **free snorkelling**, which many packages charge extra for\n- Covers three major Andaman islands comfortably\n- Offers private tour flexibility\n- Balanced duration—not too short, not too long\n\nThis makes it one of the **best value 6 Days [Andaman tour packages from India](https://indiatour.live/tours/andaman-highlights)**.\n\n\n### Who Should Choose the Amazing Andaman Tour\n### \nThis package is ideal for:\n\n- First-time visitors who want a complete Andaman experience\n- Families looking for a relaxed island holiday\n- Couples and honeymooners who want beach time + activities\n- Travellers searching for a **6 days [Andaman tour package](https://indiatour.live/tours/andaman-tour-package) with snorkelling**\n- Indian travellers who want comfort, clarity, and value\n\nExplore [Andaman Tour Packages](https://indiatour.live/tours/amazing-andaman) with India Tour Experiences!",
